# Vercel Deployment Screening Ignore (.vercelignore)
# Mencegah artefak internal, dokumentasi, skrip, dan pengujian masuk ke bundling serverless / public output

# 1. Dokumentasi Internal & Riset
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# 2. Skrip Pemeliharaan & Pipeline
scripts/

# 3. Rangkaian Pengujian Lokal & E2E
tests/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# 4. Konfigurasi CI/CD & Agent Lokal
.github/
.agents/
.vscode/

# 5. Berkas Log & Basis Data Cadangan
*.log
*.sql
